GsWandOfSparking.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: casting on the beat builds resonance, on-beat sparks chain-ignite nearby foes;
	at full resonance the next cast erupts into a fan of twelve stray sparks
	'''
GsWandOfFrosting.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: on-beat frost bolts refract into ice shards on hit, deeper resonance splits more;
	at full resonance the next cast breathes a wide cone of freezing mist that inflicts frostbite
	'''
GsThunderZapper.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: on-beat bolts zigzag like true lightning and may fork at each bend, resonance quickens the trigger;
	at full resonance the next hit brands the target and calls down a thunder pillar
	'''
GsAmethystStaff.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: on-beat bolts shatter into piercing amethyst shards on hit;
	at full resonance the next cast fires three gem bolts of neighboring hues
	'''
GsTopazStaff.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: on-beat bolts shatter into homing topaz shards on hit;
	at full resonance the next cast fires three gem bolts of neighboring hues
	'''
GsSapphireStaff.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: on-beat bolts shatter into swift sapphire lances on hit;
	at full resonance the next cast fires three gem bolts of neighboring hues
	'''
GsEmeraldStaff.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: on-beat bolts burst into one extra emerald shard on hit;
	at full resonance the next cast fires three gem bolts of neighboring hues
	'''
GsRubyStaff.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: on-beat bolts shatter into ruby shards that detonate in a small blast;
	at full resonance the next cast fires three gem bolts of neighboring hues
	'''
GsDiamondStaff.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: on-beat bolts shatter into diamond shards that refract twin light rays;
	at full resonance the next cast fires three gem bolts of neighboring hues
	'''
GsAmberStaff.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: on-beat bolts shatter into amber shards that linger as motes of stinging dust;
	at full resonance the next cast fires three gem bolts of neighboring hues
	'''
GsVilethorn.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: on-beat thorns fork into vile spikes wherever they bite;
	at full resonance the next cast also erupts a ring of thorns around you
	'''
GsWaterBolt.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: on-beat bolts bounce further and ripple on every ricochet;
	at full resonance the next cast surges into a great tide that pierces through everything
	'''
GsBookOfSkulls.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: hits brand foes into the registry, on-beat skulls hunt branded prey;
	at full resonance the next cast looses three skulls, three brands detonate into a bone burst
	'''
GsDemonScythe.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: on-beat scythes wind up faster and may boomerang back at high resonance;
	at full resonance the next cast crosses two scythes over your cursor
	'''
GsAquaScepter.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: sustained spraying swells into a surge window of crushing water pressure;
	ride three full surges and the next cast breaks into a fan of tidal slams
	'''
GsFlowerOfFire.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: on-beat fireballs burst into fans of flame tongues on first landing;
	at full resonance the next fireball blooms into a burning field where it lands
	'''
GsBeeGun.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: on-beat volleys fly in a V formation, resonance breeds bigger bees;
	at full resonance the next cast releases a queen bee that trails a living swarm
	'''
GsSpaceGun.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: every on-beat shot charges the coil, the charge never decays on a miss;
	every fourth charge discharges as a wide piercing pulse that drags in lesser foes
	'''
GsGrayZapinator.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: chaos stays chaos, but on-beat zaps always surge high voltage;
	at full resonance the next zap overloads into a swollen piercing beam
	'''
GsLaserRifle.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: every third on-beat shot splits into twin parallel lasers;
	at full resonance the next shot ignites a sweeping overdrive burst, then the barrel wilts briefly
	'''
GsWeatherPain.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: hits leave a storm eye, on-beat casts surge toward it and swell;
	high resonance twins the whirlwinds, at full resonance the next cast summons a grand storm chorus
	'''
GsCursedFlames.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: on-beat bolts plant curse seeds; the third seed ignites into a ring of cursed spikes and a lingering fire pool
	At full resonance the next cast unleashes a weaving curse serpent that sheds fire pools along its path
	'''
GsChantFlameFieldProj.DisplayName: Blazing Flower Field
GsChantStormChoirProj.DisplayName: Storm Chorus
GsCursedFlamesSerpentProj.DisplayName: Curse Serpent
GsCursedFlamesPoolProj.DisplayName: Cursed Fire Pool
GsGoldenShower.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: hits etch molten ichor; the fifth layer bursts into an eight-way spray and a dripping ichor cluster
	Spray without pause to build high pressure: faster bolts, denser streams, double etching
	'''
GsCrystalVileShard.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: on-beat spears embed crystal seeds; when the spear shatters, every seeded foe erupts in a cross of shard rays
	At full resonance the next cast raises six crystal spears around you
	'''
GsUnholyTrident.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: on-beat casts split into a trident of three prongs that sear with hellfire
	At full resonance the next cast raises four waves of infernal tridents from beneath your cursor
	'''
GsNettleBurst.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: on-beat vines take root where they bite, leaving stinging nettle thickets (up to three)
	At full resonance the next cast unleashes a great vine dragon that sweeps through the field
	'''
GsWaspGun.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: on-beat wasps sting a pheromone mark into their prey; every wasp in the air hunts the marked target first
	At full resonance the next cast releases a queen wasp that cruises ahead, seeding hunters along her path
	'''
GsGoldenShowerDripProj.DisplayName: Ichor Cluster
GsNettleBurstThicketProj.DisplayName: Nettle Thicket
GsNettleBurstDragonProj.DisplayName: Vine Dragon
GsWaspGunQueenProj.DisplayName: Queen Wasp
